FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4.5-26b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4.5 Turbo 26b is an algebraically optimized edition of Google's Gemma 4 26B-A4B MoE model built from unquantized bf16 source weights with haven-bake and IQ4_XS quantization. Expert router and down-projection scales are folded directly into weights, zero-cost QuaRot R2 head-dimension Hadamard rotation (V->O) flattens SWA attention outliers with zero runtime overhead, and full multimodal vision + thinking capabilities are preserved for CPU-only and GPU inference.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
