   ---

   This is an optimized derivative work based on google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it.
   Modifications: MoE router and expert down scale folding, zero-cost QuaRot R2 V->O Hadamard baking via haven-bake, IQ4_XS quantization from bf16 source, and multimodal vision encoder preservation.
